                "modelAnswer": "a) Metabolic parameters to monitor: (1) Fasting blood glucose, (2) HbA1c, (3) Lipid profile (total cholesterol, LDL, HDL, triglycerides), (4) Body weight/waist circumference.\n\nb) Strategies to mitigate metabolic adverse effects: (1) Encourage lifestyle modifications (diet and exercise) to promote weight loss, (2) Consider switching to a lower-risk antipsychotic (e.g., aripiprazole) if metabolic adverse effects are severe."
