                  "b": "**Empiric Therapy**:\n   - Initiate **trimethoprim-sulfamethoxazole (TMP-SMX) 15-20 mg/kg/day IV in divided doses** for 21 days for suspected PCP.\n   - Add **prednisone 40 mg PO daily for 5 days, then taper over 10 days** if the patient has severe PCP (PaO2 <70 mmHg or A-a gradient >35 mmHg).\n   - Consider alternative therapy if TMP-SMX is contraindicated or not tolerated:\n     - **Pentamidine 4mg/kg IV daily** (monitor for hypotension and hypoglycemia).\n     - **Atovaquone 750mg PO twice daily** (for mild-moderate PCP).\n     - **Clindamycin 600mg IV 8-hourly + primaquine 30mg PO daily** (for mild-moderate PCP).\n\n",
