                "stem": "Sometimes the level of immunosuppression achieved with a combination of a calcineurin inhibitor and an antimetabolite is not sufficient following an organ transplant. In this case adding an mTOR inhibitor can be beneficial because of their different mechanisms of action, which can produce a synergistic effect. An example of this drug class is:",
