                "stem": "a) Using a suitable flow chart, illustrate the metabolic pathway of acetaminophen that leads to the formation of the toxic metabolite (4 marks)\n\nb) Explain why you would be less concerned if a mother reports that her 18-month-old son took an overdose of paracetamol syrup (2 marks)",
