                "stem": "A patient takes a stimulant that produces euphoria, as well as an increase in heart rate and blood pressure. To exert its effects, this drug must be taken up into nerve terminals where it stimulates the release of norepinephrine & dopamine from their vesicular storage sites. This drug is:",
